      },
      "body": "Department of Water Supply"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-01-24",
      "text": "The plan goes to the department's advisory board and the state Water Commission for feedback.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "Qk0CE0sVrAw",
        "ts": "1:09:16",
        "endTs": "1:09:46",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:09.669Z"
      },
      "body": "Department of Water Supply"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-01-24",
      "text": "Residents can still send ideas on comment cards or by email after the meeting.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "Qk0CE0sVrAw",
        "ts": "0:38:38",
        "endTs": "0:39:11",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:09.669Z"
      },
      "body": "Department of Water Supply"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-01-24",
      "text": "Attendees got four stickers each to mark which measures the department should prioritize.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "Qk0CE0sVrAw",
        "ts": "0:36:23",
        "endTs": "0:36:53",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:09.669Z"
      },
      "body": "Department of Water Supply"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-01-24",
      "text": "One proposed ordinance (a county law) could set watering schedules by time of day or day of the week.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "Qk0CE0sVrAw",
        "ts": "0:29:42",
        "endTs": "0:30:12",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:09.669Z"
      },
      "body": "Department of Water Supply"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-01-24",
      "text": "The consultant said smart meters could save between 8 and 15% of water demand.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "Qk0CE0sVrAw",
        "ts": "0:24:54",
        "endTs": "0:25:24",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:09.669Z"
      },
      "body": "Department of Water Supply"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-01-24",
      "text": "An engineering consultant described 19 possible conservation measures in nine categories.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "Qk0CE0sVrAw",
        "ts": "0:22:28",
        "endTs": "0:22:58",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:09.669Z"
      },
      "body": "Department of Water Supply"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-01-24",
      "text": "The department is aiming for a 20% water conservation goal by 2040.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "Qk0CE0sVrAw",
        "ts": "0:18:29",
        "endTs": "0:18:59",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:09.669Z"
      },
      "body": "Department of Water Supply"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-01-24",
      "text": "Staff said low-flow fixture programs have saved about 300,000 gallons of water per day so far.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "Qk0CE0sVrAw",
        "ts": "0:07:13",
        "endTs": "0:07:43",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:09.669Z"
      },
      "body": "Department of Water Supply"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-01-24",
      "text": "The department hopes to finish the plan by the end of March.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "Qk0CE0sVrAw",
        "ts": "0:05:51",
        "endTs": "0:06:21",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:09.669Z"
      },
      "body": "Department of Water Supply"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-01-24",
      "text": "Staff said new water supply has become more and more expensive, so using existing water more efficiently helps avoid or delay new sources.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "Qk0CE0sVrAw",
        "ts": "0:03:10",
